chx:Research a res:ResearchProject ; rdfs:label "Making graphs and manipulating images: chapter 21 of the 3rd edition with Pillow and Matplotlib as they are today"@en ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the textbook ontology built over the published chapter. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-10-01T12:00:00; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.4." ;
    res:hasResearchScope chx:Scope ; rdfs:member chx:P01, chx:P02, chx:P03, chx:P04, chx:P05, chx:P06, chx:P07, chx:P08, chx:P09, chx:P10, chx:P11, chx:P12, chx:P13, chx:P14, chx:P15 .
chx:Scope a res:ResearchScope ; res:hasResearchQuestion "What does chapter 21 of the 3rd edition teach about colors, coordinates, Pillow images, drawing, the clipboard and Matplotlib graphs, which of its printed outputs, tables and programs still hold with Pillow 12.3.0 and Matplotlib 3.11.2 under Python 3.14.4, and what must an advanced course add so that it matches current practice?" ; res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-10-01." .
